msgid ""
"<0>Unrest</0> represents internal tension in the country.<1/><2/>Citizens "
"can <3>increase</3> or <4>decrease</4> unrest by spending <5>{0}</5> or "
"<6>{1}</6> to change the bar by <7>{2}</7>.<8/><9/>When the bar is full, any "
"party can vote via motion to start a <10>Civil war</10> (cost: "
"<11>development × 10</11>, cooldown: {3}h). The battle takes place in the "
"capital region, and <12>only citizens</12> can fight.<13/><14/>If "
"revolutionaries win:<15/>- Government is impeached<16/>- Borders are opened "
"for {4} days<17/>- Presidential elections begin<18/><19/>After a revolution, "
"contributions are disabled for {5}h."
msgstr ""
"<0>Unrêst</0> jout de ynterne spanning yn it lân oan.<1/><2/>Boargers kinne "
"de unrêst <3>ferheegje</3> of <4>ferleegje</4> troch <5>{0}</5> of <6>{1}</"
"6> út te jaan om de balke mei <7>{2}</7> te feroarjen.<8/><9/>As de balke "
"fol is, kin elke partij fia in moasje stimme om in <10>Boargeroarloch</10> "
"te begjinnen (kosten: <11>ûntwikkeling × 10</11>, wachttiid: {3}u). De slach "
"fynt plak yn de haadstêdregio, en <12>allinnich boargers</12> kinne "
"fjochtsje.<13/><14/>As de revolúsjonêren winne:<15/>- Wurdt de regearing "
"ôfset<16/>- Wurde de grinzen foar {4} dagen iepene<17/>- Begjinne "
"presidintsferkiezingen<18/><19/>Nei in revolúsje binne bydragen foar {5}u "
"útskeakele."

